=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap wf\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles in this category</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Who you can <em>request.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Roles in this category, each assessed before a profile is shared:</p><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>BIM Coordinator</span><span>Senior BIM Coordinator</span><span>BIM Manager</span><span>BIM Lead</span><span>BIM Specialist</span><span>BIM QA/QC Engineer</span></div></div><ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-managers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Managers</b><span>BIM Management</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-coordinators/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Coordinators</b><span>BIM Management</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-automation-specialists/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Automation Specialists</b><span>Specialized</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Hiring guidance</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What to look <em>for.</em></h2></div></div><div class=\"flow\" style=\"--line:var(--line-d)\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Standards knowledge</h3><p>Ask how they have applied ISO 19650 workflows, BEPs and CDE rules on real projects.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Coordination leadership</h3><p>Coordinators should run clash cycles and meetings, not only run clash tests.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Reporting</h3><p>Managers should show how they report model progress and quality to project leadership.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap wf\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Technical requirements</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Software we <em>assess.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Proficiency is tested in the tools the role uses, not taken from the CV.</p></div><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>Navisworks</span><span>ACC</span><span>BIM 360</span><span>Solibri</span><span>Revit</span><span>Dynamo</span></div></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap wf\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Request</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Request bim management <em>professionals.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"\">Tell us the roles, software, duration and start date. You receive assessed, anonymised profiles with the reasons they match.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=BIM%20Management%20talent\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"u\" style=\"align-self:center\" href=\"/book-consultation/\">Book a consultation</a></div></div><ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Onsite BIM Staffing</b><span>BIM Staffing</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Remote BIM Staffing</b><span>BIM Staffing</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Dedicated BIM Teams</b><span>BIM Staffing</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/verified-talent/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Verified Talent</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Good to <em>know.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>Can a BIM manager set up our BEP?<i></i></summary><p>Yes. BIM managers can prepare and maintain the BEP; ENGISOFT also offers BIM execution planning as a service.</p></details></div></div></section>","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/d